Implement the **Games** section of **The Gideonites - The Youth Alive Fellowship** Progressive Web App (PWA), faithfully matching the existing Android app (`GamesAndReportsScreen`, `BibleGamesTabContent`, `MultiplayerGameArena`, `CreateMultiplayerGameDialog`, `CreateQuizDialog`, `ActiveQuizRunner`, `BibleScripturePickerDialog`, and their repositories/models) and sharing the exact same Firebase Firestore backend and security rules.

> **Strict Scope Rule:** Implement every feature, role rule, formula, label, and Firestore contract specified below. Do **not** invent extra unrequested features, and explicitly handle every issue listed in **Section 8 (Known Bugs, Discrepancies & PWA/iOS Pitfalls)**. Note: despite the legacy Android screen name (`GamesAndReportsScreen`), the Games tab renders **exclusively Games & Trivia** (there is no weekly reports UI).

