## 7. Exact Firestore Collections, Schemas & Security Rules

Every document MUST obey `firestore.rules`:
- Valid document IDs: `^[a-zA-Z0-9_\-]+$` (1..128 chars).
- `fellowshipId == "GIDEONITES"`.
- `createdAt` and `updatedAt` MUST use `serverTimestamp()` (`<= request.time`).

### 7.1 `/quiz_sessions/{sessionId}` (ID must start with `quiz_`)
- **Required (`hasAll`)**: `hostId`, `hostName`, `fellowshipId`, `roomPin`, `titleEn`, `gameType`, `status`, `currentQuestionIndex`, `totalQuestions`, `participantCount`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`.
- **Allowed (`hasOnly` — exact 28 keys max)**: the 12 required keys + `titleYo`, `titleHa`, `titleIg`, `description`, `scheduledStartTime`, `timeLimitPerQuestionSeconds`, `leaderboardDurationSeconds`, `currentSubstate`, `currentQuestionDeadline`, `leaderboardDeadline`, `baseScorePerQuestion`, `speedBonusEnabled`, `maxSpeedBonus`, `penaltyForIncorrect`, `questionsJson`, `participantsJson`.
- **Strict Rules & Bounds**:
  - `roomPin`: 4..12 chars
  - `status`: `'DRAFT' | 'SCHEDULED' | 'ACTIVE' | 'COMPLETED' | 'CANCELLED'`
  - `currentSubstate`: `'WAITING_TO_START' | 'QUESTION_OPEN' | 'LEADERBOARD'`
  - `timeLimitPerQuestionSeconds`: `1..600`
  - `leaderboardDurationSeconds`: `1..600`
  - `baseScorePerQuestion`: `1..10000`
  - `maxSpeedBonus`: `0..5000`
  - `totalQuestions`: `1..500`
  - `questionsJson` & `participantsJson`: `<= 100,000` chars each.
  - **Host/Admin updates**: Allowed ONLY when existing `status` is NOT `'COMPLETED'` and NOT `'CANCELLED'`.
  - **Non-host updates (players joining / submitting scores)**:
    - Can ONLY modify `['participantCount', 'participantsJson', 'updatedAt']` (using `.affectedKeys().hasOnly(...)`).
    - Existing `status` MUST NOT be `'CANCELLED'` (allowed in `'SCHEDULED'`, `'ACTIVE'`, or `'COMPLETED'`).
    - `incoming.participantCount >= existing.participantCount && incoming.participantCount <= existing.participantCount + 10`.
    - **MUST use `runTransaction`** + merge existing `participantsJson` by `userId` taking `max(currentScore)`, `max(answeredQuestionsCount)`, stripping any `peer-` IDs, and writing `participantCount = max(existingCount, mergedList.length)`.
- **`questionsJson` item keys**: `id`, `gameType`, `prompt`, `options` (`string[]`), `correctAnswer`, `clues` (`string[]`), `scrambledWords` (`string[]`), `scriptureReference`, `translation`, `timerSeconds`, `points`, `explanation`.
- **`participantsJson` item keys**: `id`, `userId`, `userName`, `userRole`, `joinedAt`, `joinedAtQuestionIndex`, `currentScore`, `lastQuestionPoints`, `lastAnswerTimestamp`, `answeredQuestionsCount`.

### 7.2 `/game_quizzes/{quizId}`
- `hasAll`: `createdById`, `fellowshipId`, `title`, `category`, `questionsJson`, `totalQuestions`, `timeLimitSeconds`, `difficulty`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`.
- `hasOnly`: above + `description`.
- Bounds: `totalQuestions` `1..500`, `timeLimitSeconds` `10..7200`.
- Solo `questionsJson` item keys: `id`, `question`, `options` (`string[]`), `correctAnswerIndex` (`number`), `scriptureRef`.

### 7.3 `/game_scores/{scoreId}`
- `hasAll` & `hasOnly`: `quizId`, `quizTitle`, `userId`, `userName`, `fellowshipId`, `score`, `totalQuestions`, `timeTakenSeconds`, `completedAt`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`.
- Update rule forbids changing `userId` or `quizId`.
- Multiplayer idempotency key convention: `mp-score-{sessionId}-{userId}`.

### 7.4 `/daily_scriptures/{scriptureId}` (Shared Bible Editions & Packs Storage)
- **Bible Edition (`scripture_bibledoc_{editionId}`)**:
  - `dateKey = "BIBLE_EDITION"`
  - `prayerPromptEn = JSON.stringify({ category: "BIBLE_DOCUMENT", editionId, title, translation, fileFormat, fileName, pageOrChapterCount, extractedVersesCount, uploadedAt })`
  - Sections array (`[{ t, b, c, x }]`, max 30 sections, `t <= 100`, `b <= 40`, `c <= 700` chars) serialized to JSON and chunked across:
    - `reflectionEn` (`0..3000`)
    - `reflectionYo` (`3000..6000`)
    - `reflectionHa` (`6000..9000`)
    - `reflectionIg` (`9000..12000`)
    - `verseTextYo` (`12000..14000`)
    - `verseTextHa` (`14000..16000`)
- **Verse Pack (`scripture_biblepack_{cleanBatchKey}_{chunkIdx}`)**:
  - `dateKey = "BIBLE_PACK"`
  - `prayerPromptEn = JSON.stringify({ category: "BIBLE_VERSE_PACK", batchKey, chunkIdx })`
  - Up to 4 chunks of 35 compact verse objects (`[{ r, t, v, m }]`) chunked across `reflectionEn`..`reflectionIg`.

### 7.5 `/fellowship_notifications/{notificationId}`
- `type == "GAME_TIME"`. Sent only on live launch / scheduling (`status !== "DRAFT"`), `"Start Now"`, or `"📢 Alert All"`.

